  "solution": "**Logic followed here is that the sum of digit is same and equal to 20.**\n\nGiven, \n\n**668 – 776 – 992**\n\n**⇒ 6 + 6 + 8 = 20**\n\n**⇒ 7 + 7 + 6 = 20**\n\n**⇒ 9 + 9 + 2 = 20**\n\nCheck the option,\n\n**Option 1 - 488 – 398 – 299**\n\n**⇒ 4 + 8 + 8 = 20**\n\n**⇒ 3 + 9 + 8 = 20**\n\n**⇒ 2 + 9 + 9 = 20**\n\nOption 2 - 144 – 225 – 729 \n\n⇒ 1 + 4 + 4 = 9 ≠ 20\n\n⇒ 2 + 2 + 5 = 9 ≠ 20\n\n⇒ 7 + 2 + 9 = 19 ≠ 20\n\nOption 3 - 725 – 623 – 542 \n\n⇒ 7 + 2 + 5 = 14 ≠ 20\n\n⇒ 6 + 2 + 3 = 11 ≠ 20\n\n⇒ 5 + 4 + 2 = 11 ≠ 20 \n\nOption 4 - 195 – 285 – 348\n\n⇒ 1 + 9 + 5 = 15 ≠ 20\n\n⇒ 2 + 8 + 5 = 15 ≠ 20\n\n⇒ 3 + 4 + 8 = 15 ≠ 20\n\n**Option 1 follow the pattern.**\n\nHence the correct answer is **Option 1.**",
